      "content": "wait, u said drill is \"premium/mainstream\" but then said AAVE slang is \"lower-income/street\"? that seems a bit contradictory since drill is basically built on that slang. also, why would reggaeton fall into a different category? i didn't see u touch on that one. could u expand on why certain linguistic or musical styles are tied to \"lower-income\" vs \"premium\" demographics in your analysis? like what's the actual logic there?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
